.etcs_history
.db
Makefile
# Loader build outputs -- mirrors loaders/Makefile's own `clean` target
# (Run_*Loader, etcs, *.o) so the two can't drift apart. This is what
# `2508dbe` committed by accident: a `git add .` after a build stages
# these unless they're ignored in both the dir they're built in and the
# dir copy_loaders moves them to.
loaders/Run_*Loader
loaders/etcs
loaders/*.o
logs/
bin/
*_hashes.h
*db
*db-shm
*db-wal
# Generated by `ace deps generate` (ACE-Build-Tools dev_tools/ace/ace_generate.py)
# from pinned sources; byte-identical on every machine, hashed into the epoch.
core/AirtyMacros_Generated.h
libs/monocypher.h
core/AceIdentity.h
# What the site serves at /dist (ace publish) and the certificates above its registrar.
dist/
pki/
